{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/learn/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/page,_N_T_/learn/taiwan-stock-market-recap-2026-08-15"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--2DJ2zhzL_dHSrK5QsdDKA--><html lang=\"zh-TW\" data-density=\"comfortable\" data-font-size=\"standard\" class=\"__variable_07e1b6 __variable_cc7473 h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/6e1768769e6f59a2-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ab2e3a11646b0499-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/75c047ba52e43fcc.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/aa90c9a426448e43.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/e55779c04dd245e2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8c57d5c3b938342e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/3eaf36e367672966.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-ab54a41c275880be.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-acf4587a940f1946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/learn/%5Bslug%5D/page-f7b99344f7e2ee16.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>2026年8月14日台股盤後：加權指數收跌，櫃買跌幅較深｜股市大佬 TradeBoss</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"2026年8月14日台股加權指數今日終場以45811.01點作收，下跌0.45%。櫃買指數跌幅相對較大，收在400.95點，下跌1.27%，顯示中小型股今日承壓。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-theme');if(t!=='light'&&t!=='dark')t='dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);document.documentElement.style.colorScheme=(t==='light'?'light':'dark');}catch(e){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark');}})();(function(){try{if(localStorage.getItem('obsidian-comfort-read')==='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('comfort-read');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var s=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-updown');if(s==='us')document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-updown','us');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var prefs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('bs-preferences-v1')||'{}');var root=document.documentElement;prefs=prefs&&typeof prefs==='object'?prefs:{};root.setAttribute('data-font-size',['standard','large','xlarge','huge'].indexOf(prefs.fontSize)>=0?prefs.fontSize:'standard');root.setAttribute('data-density',prefs.density==='compact'?'compact':'comfortable');}catch(e){}})();</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground selection:bg-cyan/30 review-mode pb-40 lg:pb-16\" data-review-theme=\"dark\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link fixed left-3 top-3 z-[80] -translate-y-24 rounded-xl bg-accent px-4 py-2 font-black text-bg shadow-lg transition focus:translate-y-0\">跳到主要內容</a><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_wrap__LIQ8G\"><article class=\"LearnArticle_article__2nBbk\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_meta__etj_G\"><a class=\"LearnArticle_cat__GQMlg\" href=\"/learn?c=recap\">盤後解讀</a><span class=\"LearnArticle_read__QEj6a\">閱讀約 5 分鐘</span></p><h1 class=\"LearnArticle_title__0_la8\">2026年8月14日台股盤後：加權指數收跌，櫃買跌幅較深</h1><details class=\"LearnArticle_toc__LcSAa\"><summary class=\"LearnArticle_tocSummary__YBddG\">本文目錄</summary><ol class=\"LearnArticle_tocList__Rq_Lz\"><li><a href=\"#sec-1\">一、大盤指數表現概況</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-2\">二、盤面族群強弱分析</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-3\">三、個股漲跌幅與當沖熱門</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-4\">四、法人籌碼與融資狀況</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-5\">五、國際股市與市場消息</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-6\">常見問題 FAQ</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-7\">總結</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-8\">延伸閱讀</a></li></ol></details><div class=\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\">2026年8月14日台股加權指數今日終場以45811.01點作收，下跌0.45%。櫃買指數跌幅相對較大，收在400.95點，下跌1.27%，顯示中小型股今日承壓。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\"><b class=\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\">本文重點</b><ul class=\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\"><li>加權指數小幅收跌，櫃買指數跌幅相對較深。</li><li>玻璃陶瓷、數位雲端等族群今日表現較為強勢。</li><li>半導體、電子通路等族群呈現走弱。</li><li>外資在台指期貨市場的淨空單部位較高。</li></ul></div><section id=\"sec-1\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">一、大盤指數表現概況</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">今日台股大盤呈現開高走低，加權指數最終收盤下跌，而上櫃市場的櫃買指數跌幅則更為明顯。整體上市股票下跌家數遠多於上漲家數，顯示市場氣氛偏向保守。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\"><table class=\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\"><thead><tr><th>指數名稱</th><th>收盤價</th><th>漲跌幅</th><th>漲跌家數</th><th>成交金額</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>加權指數</td><td>45811.01</td><td>-0.45%</td><td>上漲285、下跌653</td><td>約10233.0億</td></tr><tr><td>櫃買指數</td><td>400.95</td><td>-1.27%</td><td>資料未提供</td><td>資料未提供</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"sec-2\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">二、盤面族群強弱分析</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">在大盤整體走弱的背景下，今日盤面仍有部分族群展現相對強勢，例如玻璃陶瓷與數位雲端類股，而半導體族群則承受較大賣壓。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>玻璃陶瓷族群上漲2.22%，其中和成（1810）漲幅接近一成。</li><li>數位雲端類股上漲2.09%，由智通*（8932）領漲。</li><li>航運業上漲1.63%，漢翔（2634）表現強勢。</li><li>存託憑證類股上漲1.26%，泰金寶-DR（9105）領漲。</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-3\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">三、個股漲跌幅與當沖熱門</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">今日上市個股表現分歧，有股票漲幅較大，也有股票跌幅較深。在當沖交易方面，部分個股成交量相對自身過去交易量有顯著放大，顯示交易熱度集中。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\"><li>今日上市跌幅較大的股票包括揚博（2493）下跌9.96%、樺漢（6414）下跌9.76%等。</li><li>當沖熱門股中，威聯通（量比24.0x）、廣寰科（量比15.6x）、東研信超（量比14.9x）等成交量比值較高。</li></ul><div class=\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\"><table class=\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\"><thead><tr><th>股票代號</th><th>股票名稱</th><th>漲跌幅</th><th>成交量</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1515</td><td>力山</td><td>+10.00%</td><td>2850張</td></tr><tr><td>1810</td><td>和成</td><td>+9.98%</td><td>24344張</td></tr><tr><td>2915</td><td>潤泰全</td><td>+9.98%</td><td>14058張</td></tr><tr><td>2634</td><td>漢翔</td><td>+9.97%</td><td>79395張</td></tr><tr><td>2392</td><td>正崴</td><td>+9.96%</td><td>16947張</td></tr><tr><td>9945</td><td>潤泰新</td><td>+9.96%</td><td>37276張</td></tr></tbody></table></div><figure class=\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\">!外資期貨空單!法人現貨買超!美股小幅下跌!亞洲表現分歧</div><figcaption class=\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\">籌碼與國際動態</figcaption></figure></section><section id=\"sec-4\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">四、法人籌碼與融資狀況</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">今日盤後統計顯示，外資在台指期貨市場的淨空單部位較高。在現貨市場，外資與自營商的買賣超數據顯示，兩者皆呈現買超。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\"><li>外資台指期淨空單為85,179口。</li><li>外資現貨呈現買超約569,871張。</li><li>自營商現貨呈現買超約413,731張。</li><li>全市場融資維持率為194.1%。</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-5\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">五、國際股市與市場消息</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">觀察國際主要股市表現，美股主要指數昨日多呈現小幅下跌，而亞洲市場則有漲有跌。今日台灣相關的市場消息主要圍繞在特定權值股的討論。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\"><li>今日台股新聞標題多聚焦於2330台積電的市場討論，內容涵蓋KD指標、被動元件、PCB散熱、財測與股價走勢等面向。</li><li>近期國際消息方面，有中國擴張亞洲版圖、川普聚焦伊朗問題、美國敦促蘋果勿採中國記憶體晶片，以及川普簽署備忘錄授權民間發動網路攻擊等報導。</li></ul><div class=\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\"><table class=\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\"><thead><tr><th>國際指數</th><th>漲跌幅</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>S&amp;P 500</td><td>-0.17%</td></tr><tr><td>那斯達克</td><td>-0.28%</td></tr><tr><td>費城半導體</td><td>-0.31%</td></tr><tr><td>韓國綜合（KOSPI）</td><td>+2.42%</td></tr><tr><td>日經225</td><td>+0.59%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"sec-6\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">常見問題 FAQ</h2><div class=\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\"><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>今天台股大盤怎麼走？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">2026年8月14日台股加權指數下跌0.45%，收在45811.01點。櫃買指數跌幅較深，下跌1.27%，收在400.95點。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>哪些族群今天表現比較好？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">今日盤面中，玻璃陶瓷族群上漲2.22%，數位雲端類股上漲2.09%，航運業上漲1.63%，存託憑證類股上漲1.26%，這些族群表現相對強勢。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>外資今天在台股有什麼動作？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">外資今日在台指期貨市場持有85,179口淨空單。在現貨市場，外資呈現買超約569,871張，自營商也買超約413,731張。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>國際股市對台股有影響嗎？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">今日國際主要股市表現分歧，美股三大指數昨日小幅下跌，而亞洲的韓國綜合指數與日經225指數則呈現上漲。這些國際盤勢與台股今日的表現同時發生。</p></details></div></section><section id=\"sec-7\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">總結</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">總體而言，今日台股加權指數小幅收跌，櫃買指數跌幅較大，市場交易氣氛偏向觀望，部分傳產與數位雲端類股表現突出，而半導體族群則相對承壓。</p></section><section id=\"sec-8\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">延伸閱讀</h2><ul class=\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\"><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/diary\">新手導覽</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/school\">台股學堂</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/diary\">大盤總覽</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/diary\">法遵與免責聲明</a></li></ul></section></div></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[81259,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[89379,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[98924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[10021,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[10528,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n8:I[50861,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nc:I[57150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/6e1768769e6f59a2-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/ab2e3a11646b0499-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/75c047ba52e43fcc.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/aa90c9a426448e43.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static