children\":\"全市場融資維持率為194.1%。\"}]]}]]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-5\",{\"id\":\"sec-5\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"五、國際股市與市場消息\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"觀察國際主要股市表現，美股主要指數昨日多呈現小幅下跌，而亞洲市場則有漲有跌。今日台灣相關的市場消息主要圍繞在特定權值股的討論。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"今日台股新聞標題多聚焦於2330台積電的市場討論，內容涵蓋KD指標、被動元件、PCB散熱、財測與股價走勢等面向。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"近期國際消息方面，有中國擴張亞洲版圖、川普聚焦伊朗問題、美國敦促蘋果勿採中國記憶體晶片，以及川普簽署備忘錄授權民間發動網路攻擊等報導。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"國際指數\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"漲跌幅\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"S&P 500\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-0.17%\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"那斯達克\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-0.28%\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"費城半導體\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-0.31%\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"韓國綜合（KOSPI）\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"+2.42%\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"4\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"日經225\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"+0.59%\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-6\",{\"id\":\"sec-6\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}],[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"今天台股大盤怎麼走？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"2026年8月14日台股加權指數下跌0.45%，收在45811.01點。櫃買指數跌幅較深，下跌1.27%，收在400.95點。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"哪些族群今天表現比較好？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"今日盤面中，玻璃陶瓷族群上漲2.22%，數位雲端類股上漲2.09%，航運業上漲1.63%，存託憑證類股上漲1.26%，這些族群表現相對強勢。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"外資今天在台股有什麼動作？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"外資今日在台指期貨市場持有85,179口淨空單。在現貨市場，外資呈現買超約569,871張，自營商也買超約413,731張。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"國際股市對台股有影響嗎？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"今日國際主要股市表現分歧，美股三大指數昨日小幅下跌，而亞洲的韓國綜合指數與日經225指數則呈現上漲。這些國際盤勢與台股今日的表現同時發生。\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-7\",{\"id\":\"sec-7\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"總結\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"總體而言，今日台股加權指數小幅收跌，櫃買指數跌幅較大，市場交易氣氛偏向觀望，部分傳產與數位雲端類股表現突出，而半導體族群則相對承壓。\"}]]]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-8\",{\"id\":\"sec-8\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}],[[\"$\",\"ul\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-新手導覽\",{\"href\":\"/diary\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"新手導覽\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-